# 17. Long-Term Architecture

```text
                         Internet / VPN
                               |
                  +------------+------------+
                  |                         |
             Windows PC                 iPhone/Browser
             Tkinter GUI                    Web GUI
                  |                         |
                  +----------- HTTP --------+
                              |
                         WireGuard/LAN
                              |
                       Raspberry Pi 5
                              |
                 +------------+------------+
                 |                         |
              FastAPI                 Services
                                           |
                                       SQLAlchemy
                                           |
                                         SQLite
                                           |
